Reproduction from this proof repository
  bash scripts/reproduce.sh
The script uses git and elan, downloads the pinned dependencies and Mathlib cache,
builds both project libraries, and runs the theorem axiom audit.

Fresh-run procedure
  1. Create an empty directory. Extract AC.lean, lean-toolchain, and lakefile.toml
     from competition/tools/lean in the upstream Git revision printed above.
  2. Append the ACProof library configuration shown above. Copy lean/ACProof/*.lean
     from this proof repository into ACProof/ and check the SHA-256 inventory below.
  3. Provide the locked lake-manifest.json and its prebuilt .lake/packages dependencies.
     The project starts with an empty build cache. The Lean import search path is set by Lake.
  4. Run the following two commands from the fresh project root.
       lake build AC ACProof
       lake env lean ACProof/Check.lean

